==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is based on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Indeedee V|91}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Watch Over''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Indeedee V|91}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*{{m|Psychic}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Indeedee}} can learn.

